@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Pacific Cross Vietnam, Travel Insurance Policy / Quy tắc bảo hiểm du lịch (row VN-06).
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../source/raw/pacificcross-travel.txt, the text rendering of
-- Travel-Insurance-Policy-Wording-ENG-VN_042023-1.pdf (PDF sha256 29aaa4b9...e1e92),
-- retrieved 2026-10-06. `src:N` is line N of that file. The English text is lines 1-1077,
-- the Vietnamese text lines 1079-2208. Every `src:` line is generated by tools/vnsrc.py.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND), a bare NUMBER. Hours, days and metres are bare NUMBERs
-- and the unit is in the field name.
-- Membership test: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact, or the
-- Insurance Certificate, a receipt or a report records it. Whether the fact makes a benefit
-- payable is a rule, and belongs in the module for the section that says so.

§ `Nouns for the Pacific Cross travel insurance wording`

§§ `The two texts of the instrument`

-- The wording is printed twice, English then Vietnamese, and states no rule of precedence
-- between them (NOTES.md §1). A rule whose two texts differ in meaning takes the version.
DECLARE `Text version` IS ONE OF
    `the English text`
    `the Vietnamese text`

§§ `Products, plans and sections the wording names`

-- The wording names three products and five plans and defines none of them; which applies
-- is read off the Insurance Certificate.
-- src:111 | 7. This Policy is non-cancelable by the Company or by the
-- src:112 | Policyholder (unless it is Annual Travel Policy) except in the
-- src:1203 | 7. Công ty hoặc Chủ Hợp Đồng không thể hủy Hợp đồng bảo
-- src:1204 | hiểm này (ngoại trừ đó là hợp đồng bảo hiểm du lịch Annual
-- src:1205 | Travel) trừ trường hợp Công ty không nhận được phí bảo
-- src:191 | Travel Flex Section:
-- src:1287 | Phần áp dụng riêng cho Travel Flex:
-- src:466 | (applicable to Bon Voyage only): The amount payable for
-- src:1564 | công cộng” (chỉ áp dụng cho bảo hiểm du lịch Bon Voyage): Số
DECLARE `Product` IS ONE OF
    `Annual Travel`
    `Travel Flex`
    `Bon Voyage`
    `a product the wording does not name`

-- src:385 | Insured Person, up to a maximum benefit of VND 100,000,000
-- src:386 | for Plan A and Premier Plan; VND 70,000,000 for Plan B and
-- src:387 | Executive Plan and VND 40,000,000 for Plan C, when required.
-- src:1479 | bảo hiểm cần phải có sự điều trị y tế. Mức quyền lợi tối đa
-- src:1480 | là 100.000.000 VND cho Hạng A và Hạng cao cấp; 70.000.000
-- src:1481 | VND cho Hạng B và Hạng phổ thông, và 40.000.000 VND cho
-- src:1482 | Hạng C.
DECLARE `Plan` IS ONE OF
    `Plan A`
    `Plan B`
    `Plan C`
    `Premier Plan`      -- Hạng cao cấp
    `Executive Plan`    -- Hạng phổ thông (see GLOSSARY.md: a translation risk)

-- The insuring sections, numbered as the English numbers them. Each is "if applicable as
-- per Schedule of Benefit"; the Certificate lists those that apply.
DECLARE `Section` IS ONE OF
    `1A Medical Expenses`
    `1B Emergency Assistance`
    `2 Personal Accident`
    `3 Baggage and Personal Effects`
    `4 Baggage Delay`
    `5 Loss of Travel Document`
    `6 Personal Money`
    `7 Travel Delay`
    `8 Curtailment of Trip or Cancellation Charges`
    `9 Personal Liability`
    `10 Incidental Home Country`
    `11 Rental Car Excess Cover`
    `12 Optional Rental Car Protection`

§§ `The Insurance Certificate`

-- Every figure the wording leaves to "the limit set out in the Insurance Certificate" is an
-- input with no default. NOTHING means the Certificate states no such limit; a rule that
-- needs it then refuses by name.
-- src:560 | The Company will pay up to the limit set out in the Insurance
-- src:561 | Certificate for each Insured Person for emergency purchases
-- src:1663 | Công ty sẽ chi trả, tối đa cho đến mức giới hạn được ghi trong Giấy
-- src:1664 | chứng nhận bảo hiểm cho mỗi Người được bảo hiểm cho việc mua
DECLARE `The limits set out in the Insurance Certificate` HAS
    `Medical Expenses`              IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `Hospital Cash Allowance`       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `Personal Accident sum insured` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `Baggage and Personal Effects`  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `Baggage Delay`                 IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `Loss of Travel Document`       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `Personal Money`                IS A MAYBE NUMBER

-- "Period of Insurance" is whatever the Certificate says it is:
-- src:945 | “Period of Insurance” means the period of insurance specified in
-- src:946 | the Insurance Certificate as the Period of Insurance.
-- src:2072 | “Thời gian bảo hiểm” là thời gian được ghi là Thời gian bảo hiểm
-- src:2073 | trong Giấy Chứng Nhận Bảo Hiểm.
-- `effective date of the Policy` is the date the Pre-Existing Condition definition and
-- section 10 count from; `date of issue of the Policy` is the date section 8 and clause 13
-- count from. The wording uses both and defines neither; the Certificate records both.
DECLARE `The Insurance Certificate` HAS
    `plan`                                          IS A `Plan`
    `product`                                       IS A `Product`
    `date of issue of the Policy`                   IS A DATE
    `effective date of the Policy`                  IS A DATE
    `first day of the Period of Insurance`          IS A DATE
    `last day of the Period of Insurance`           IS A DATE
    `sections applicable per the Schedule of Benefit` IS A LIST OF `Section`
    `limits`                                        IS A `The limits set out in the Insurance Certificate`
    `premium paid`                                  IS A NUMBER
    `annual premium`                                IS A NUMBER
    `premium received by the Company`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `Rental Car Protection applied for in the Application and its additional premium paid` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The Insured Person and the trip`

-- src:933 | “Insured Person” means any one of the persons specifically listed
-- src:934 | and named in the Insurance Certificate as an Insured Person.
-- src:2057 | “Người được bảo hiểm” là bất kỳ người nào trong những người
-- src:2058 | được liệt kê một cách cụ thể và được ghi tên là Người được bảo
-- src:2059 | hiểm trong Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm.
DECLARE `The Insured Person` HAS
    `date of birth`                                                   IS A DATE
    `listed and named in the Insurance Certificate as an Insured Person` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:106 | 6. This Policy is only valid for leisure travel or business travel
-- src:107 | (limited to administrative and non manual works only).
-- src:1200 | 6. Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này chỉ có giá trị cho việc du lịch hoặc đi
-- src:1201 | công tác nước ngoài (giới hạn chỉ cho công việc hành chính và
-- src:1202 | không phải là công việc chân tay).
DECLARE `Purpose of the trip` IS ONE OF
    `leisure travel`
    `business travel limited to administrative and non-manual work`
    `business travel involving manual work`
    `travel for another purpose`

-- The trip the event happened on. `date of return to the Country of Origin` is NOTHING while
-- the Insured Person has not returned.
DECLARE `The trip` HAS
    `purpose`                                         IS A `Purpose of the trip`
    `date of departure from the Country of Origin`    IS A DATE
    `scheduled departure date on the itinerary`       IS A DATE
    `date of return to the Country of Origin`         IS A MAYBE DATE
    `accompanied by an adult also insured under the same Policy` IS A BOOLEAN

-- The facts every claim is subject to, from clauses 1 and 16.
-- Clause 1 (src:13, src:1093) and clause 16 (src:167, src:1264) are quoted in pc-travel-general.l4.
DECLARE `The case` HAS
    `certificate`                                                  IS A `The Insurance Certificate`
    `insured person`                                               IS A `The Insured Person`
    `trip`                                                         IS A `The trip`
    `the Insured Person and the claimant observed the terms they were to comply with` IS A BOOLEAN
    `every statement in the application forms and declarations is true` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a claim was fraudulent or intentionally exaggerated, or a false declaration or statement was made` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The circumstances clause 5 excludes`

-- Clause 5.2 lists its Disabilities by name. The English and the Vietnamese lists have the
-- same members in the same order; the Vietnamese prints "hypertension, cardiovascular
-- diseases" with a comma where the English joins them with "or" (NOTES.md §4, F-list).
-- src:40 | 5.2. The following Disabilities whether occurring prior
-- src:41 | to or during the Period of Insurance: hemorrhoids,
-- src:42 | hernia, diseased tonsils requiring surgery, pathological
-- src:43 | abnormalities of nasal septum or turbinate,
-- src:44 | hyperthyroidism, cataracts, sinus conditions requiring
-- src:45 | surgery, endometriosis, tuberculosis, anal fistulae,
-- src:46 | cholecystitis, calculi of all kinds, urethra or bladder
-- src:47 | abnormalities or disease, hypertension or cardiovascular
-- src:48 | diseases, cerebrovascular accident/ transient ischemic
-- src:49 | attack, gastric or duodenal ulcer, hallux valgus, all
-- src:50 | forms of tumors or cancer, malignancies, disorders
-- src:51 | of blood or bone marrow, diabetes mellitus and HIV
-- src:52 | (human immunodeficiency virus) and HIV related
-- src:53 | illness including AIDS (Acquired Immunity Deficiency
-- src:54 | Syndrome) and AIDS related conditions.
-- src:1123 | 5.2 Những bệnh tật sau đây cho dù xảy ra trước hoặc trong
-- src:1124 | thời gian bảo hiểm: bệnh trĩ, chứng thoát vị, bệnh amidan
-- src:1125 | cần phải phẫu thuật, những bất thường bệnh lý của vách
-- src:1126 | ngăn mũi hoặc xương xoăn, chứng cường tuyến giáp,
-- src:1127 | bệnh đục thủy tinh thể, bệnh xoang cần phải phẫu thuật,
-- src:1128 | lạc nội mạc tử cung, lao, rò hậu môn, viêm túi mật, các
-- src:1129 | loại sỏi, các bất thường hoặc bệnh về bàng quang hoặc
-- src:1130 | niệu đạo, cao huyết áp, các bệnh tim mạch, tai biến mạch
-- src:1131 | máu não/cơn thiếu máu cục bộ nhất thời, loét dạ dày
-- src:1132 | hoặc tá tràng, ngón chân cái quẹo ra, các loại u bướu hay
-- src:1133 | ung thư, các bệnh ác tính, các rối loạn về máu hoặc tủy
-- src:1134 | xương, bệnh tiểu đường, HIV (vi rút gây suy giảm miễn
-- src:1135 | dịch ở người) và các bệnh liên quan đến HIV bao gồm cả
-- src:1136 | AIDS (Hội chứng suy giảm miễn dịch mắc phải) và các
-- src:1137 | trạng thái liên quan đến AIDS.
DECLARE `A Disability named in clause 5.2` IS ONE OF
    `hemorrhoids`
    `hernia`
    `diseased tonsils requiring surgery`
    `pathological abnormalities of nasal septum or turbinate`
    `hyperthyroidism`
    `cataracts`
    `sinus conditions requiring surgery`
    `endometriosis`
    `tuberculosis`
    `anal fistulae`
    `cholecystitis`
    `calculi of all kinds`
    `urethra or bladder abnormalities or disease`
    `hypertension or cardiovascular diseases`
    `cerebrovascular accident or transient ischemic attack`
    `gastric or duodenal ulcer`
    `hallux valgus`
    `all forms of tumors or cancer`
    `malignancies`
    `disorders of blood or bone marrow`
    `diabetes mellitus`
    `HIV and HIV related illness including AIDS and AIDS related conditions`

-- Clause 5.7 lists the activities during which an accident is excluded. Two carry the facts
-- on which the English and the Vietnamese part company (NOTES.md §4, VN-F1, VN-F3).
-- The whole clause is quoted in pc-travel-general.l4; the activities are:
-- src:86 | 5.7. Accidents whilst engaging in (including any practice
-- src:87 | or conditioning program for) any sports or games in a
-- src:88 | professional capacity or organized contact sports, racing
-- src:89 | (other than on foot), motor rallies and competitions,
-- src:90 | rock or mountain climbing normally involving the use
-- src:91 | of ropes or other equipment, potholing, skydiving, hang
-- src:92 | gliding, parachuting, hunting on horseback, entering/
-- src:93 | descending or flying in any aircraft other than a properly
-- src:94 | licensed aircraft operated by a recognized airline in
-- src:95 | which the Insured Person is traveling as a fare-paying
-- src:96 | passenger, engaging in any kind of manual labor work
-- src:97 | either in business or leisure, or engaging in hazardous
-- src:98 | works including but not limited to offshore activities,
-- src:99 | commercial diving, oil well drilling, mining, handling
-- src:100 | of explosive, construction site working, stunt works and
-- src:101 | aerial photography.
-- src:1176 | 5.7 Các tai nạn xảy ra trong khi tham gia vào (bao gồm cả việc
-- src:1177 | luyện tập hoặc chương trình rèn luyện thể lực cho việc đó)
-- src:1178 | bất kỳ môn thể thao hoặc trò chơi nào mang tính chuyên
-- src:1179 | nghiệp hoặc các môn thể thao tiếp xúc có tổ chức, các cuộc
-- src:1180 | đua (không phải bằng chân), các cuộc đua xe và thi đấu xe
-- src:1181 | có động cơ, leo đá hoặc leo núi có sử dụng dây thừng hoặc
-- src:1182 | thiết bị khác, khám phá hang động, nhảy dù biểu diễn,
-- src:1183 | diều lượn, nhảy dù, cưỡi ngựa săn bắn, lên/xuống hoặc đi
-- src:1184 | trên máy bay như là một hành khách có mua vé trên máy
-- src:1185 | bay không được cấp giấy phép hợp lệ của một hãng hàng
-- src:1186 | không không được công nhận, tham gia vào bất kỳ loại
-- src:1187 | công việc lao động chân tay nào dù là trong công việc hay
-- src:1188 | trong lúc nhàn rỗi, hoặc tham gia vào các công việc nguy
-- src:1189 | hiểm bao gồm nhưng không chỉ giới hạn ở các hoạt động
-- src:1190 | ngoài khơi, việc lặn mang tính thương mại, khoan giếng
-- src:1191 | dầu, khai mỏ, điều khiển chất nổ, làm việc ở công trường
-- src:1192 | xây dựng, đóng thế và chụp ảnh trên không.
DECLARE `An activity named in clause 5.7` IS ONE OF
    `a sport or game in a professional capacity`
    `an organized contact sport`
    `racing, other than on foot`
    `a motor rally or competition`
    `rock or mountain climbing` HAS
        `normally involving the use of ropes or other equipment` IS A BOOLEAN
        `ropes or other equipment were used`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `potholing`
    `skydiving`
    `hang gliding`
    `parachuting`
    `hunting on horseback`
    `entering, descending or flying in an aircraft` HAS
        `the aircraft is properly licensed`                      IS A BOOLEAN
        `operated by a recognized airline`                       IS A BOOLEAN
        `the Insured Person is a fare-paying passenger`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `manual labor work, in business or leisure`
    `hazardous work`
    `an activity clause 5.7 does not name`

-- What a loss arose from, as a witness would describe it. A claim lists every one that
-- applies; an empty list says the loss arose from nothing clause 5 names.
-- src:37 | 5. The Policy does not cover losses arising from:
-- src:1113 | 5. Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này không bồi thường cho những tổn thất
-- src:1114 | phát sinh từ:
DECLARE `A circumstance named in clause 5` IS ONE OF
    `a Pre-existing Illness or Injury`                                                       -- 5.1
    `a congenital condition or birth defect`                                                 -- 5.1
    `a Disability named in clause 5.2` HAS `the Disability` IS A `A Disability named in clause 5.2`
    `war or a warlike event named in clause 5.3`                                             -- 5.3
    `mutiny, riot or civil commotion` HAS
        `assuming the proportions of or amounting to a popular rising` IS A BOOLEAN          -- 5.3
    `an act of terrorism, or action taken in controlling, preventing or suppressing one`     -- 5.4
    `suicide, attempted suicide or intentional self-inflicted bodily injury`                 -- 5.5
    `a psychiatric or mental disorder, or insanity`                                          -- 5.5
    `abortion, miscarriage or child birth`                                                   -- 5.5
    `venereal disease`                                                                       -- 5.5
    `the use of alcohol`                                                                     -- 5.5
    `the use of drugs or solvents` HAS
        `prescribed by a qualified registered physician` IS A BOOLEAN                        -- 5.5
    `dental treatment` HAS
        `resulting from accidental bodily injury to sound and natural teeth` IS A BOOLEAN    -- 5.5
    `nuclear fission, nuclear fusion or radioactive contamination`                           -- 5.6
    `an accident whilst engaging in` HAS `the activity` IS AN `An activity named in clause 5.7` -- 5.7
    `trekking` HAS `altitude above sea level in metres` IS A NUMBER                         -- 5.8
    `scuba diving` HAS `depth below sea level in metres` IS A NUMBER                        -- 5.8
    `an indirect or consequential loss`                                                      -- 5.9

§§ `Definitions that are facts`

-- src:876 | “Accident” means an event occurring entirely beyond the Insured
-- src:877 | Person’s control and caused by violent, external and visible means.
-- src:1996 | “Tai nạn” là một sự cố xảy ra hoàn toàn ngoài tầm kiểm soát của
-- src:1997 | Người được bảo hiểm và được gây ra bởi phương tiện hữu hình,
-- src:1998 | bên ngoài và mạnh mẽ.
DECLARE `The facts of an event` HAS
    `entirely beyond the Insured Person's control`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `caused by violent, external and visible means`      IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Illness or Injury` IS ONE OF
    `an Illness`
    `an Injury`

-- The facts the definitions of Illness and Injury turn on.
-- src:921 | “Illness” means a sickness or disease marked by a pathological
-- src:922 | deviation from the normal healthy state, which requires treatment
-- src:923 | by a Physician, Specialist or Surgeon.
-- src:2038 | “Ốm đau” là sự đau ốm hoặc bệnh được biểu thị bằng một sự lệch
-- src:2039 | có tính bệnh lý ra khỏi tình trạng sức khỏe bình thường và cần phải
-- src:2040 | có sự điều trị của Bác sĩ, Chuyên gia hoặc Bác sĩ phẫu thuật.
-- src:928 | “Injury” means a bodily Injury (which for the avoidance of doubt
-- src:929 | excludes psychiatric conditions) arising wholly and exclusively
-- src:930 | from an Accident which independently of all other causes (i)
-- src:931 | directly results in death within 12 calendar months of the date of
-- src:932 | the Accident, or (ii) necessitates medical and/or surgical treatment.
-- src:2051 | “Thương tích” là Thương tích trên thân thể (loại trừ những tình
-- src:2052 | trạng tâm thần) phát sinh hoàn toàn và duy nhất từ một Tai nạn và
-- src:2053 | độc lập với tất cả các nguyên nhân khác:
-- src:2054 | (i) trực tiếp dẫn đến tử vong trong vòng 12 tháng dương lịch
-- src:2055 | kể từ ngày xảy ra Tai nạn, hoặc
-- src:2056 | (ii) cần phải có sự điều trị y tế và/hoặc phẫu thuật.
DECLARE `The facts of an Illness or Injury` HAS
    `kind`                                                        IS AN `Illness or Injury`
    `a pathological deviation from the normal healthy state`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `requires treatment by a Physician, Specialist or Surgeon`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `a bodily injury, not a psychiatric condition`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the event that caused it`                                    IS A `The facts of an event`
    `arising wholly and exclusively from that event, independently of all other causes` IS A BOOLEAN
    `necessitates medical or surgical treatment`                  IS A BOOLEAN

-- The physician's findings the definition of "Serious Injury or Illness" turns on, for the
-- Insured Person (first sentence) or an Immediate Family Member (second sentence).
-- src:977 | “Serious Injury or Illness” means when an Insured Person requires
-- src:978 | treatment by a Physician and which results in the Insured Person
-- src:979 | being certified by that Physician as being dangerous to life and
-- src:980 | unfit to travel or continue with his original journey. When “Serious
-- src:981 | Injury or Illness” is applied to the Insured Person’s Immediate
-- src:982 | Family Member, it shall mean Injury or Illness certified as being
-- src:983 | dangerous to life by Physician and which results in the Insured
-- src:984 | Person’s discontinuation or cancellation of his original journey.
-- src:2105 | “Thương tích nghiêm trọng hoặc ốm đau nặng” là khi Người
-- src:2106 | được bảo hiểm cần phải được một Bác sĩ điều trị và được Bác sĩ
-- src:2107 | đó chứng nhận là nguy hiểm đến tính mạng và không đủ sức khỏe
-- src:2108 | để đi du lịch hoặc tiếp tục chuyến hành trình gốc của mình. Khi
-- src:2109 | “Thương tích nghiêm trọng hoặc ốm đau nặng” được áp dụng cho
-- src:2110 | Người thân gia đình trực hệ của Người được bảo hiểm, thì nó có
-- src:2111 | nghĩa là Thương tích hoặc Ốm đau được Bác sĩ chứng nhận là nguy
-- src:2112 | hiểm đến tính mạng và điều này dẫn đến việc Người được bảo
-- src:2113 | hiểm phải gián đoạn hoặc hủy chuyến hành trình gốc của mình.
DECLARE `A Physician's findings` HAS
    `requires treatment by a Physician`                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `certified by that Physician as dangerous to life`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `certified unfit to travel or to continue the original journey`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `results in the Insured Person's discontinuation or cancellation of the original journey` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:962 | “Pre-Existing Condition” means any Illness, disease or physical
-- src:963 | condition which existed before the effective date of the Policy in
-- src:964 | respect of the Insured Person, which presents signs or symptoms
-- src:965 | of which the Insured Person was aware or should reasonable have
-- src:966 | been aware.
-- src:2089 | “Tình trạng tồn tại trước” là bất kỳ Ốm đau, bệnh tật hoặc tình
-- src:2090 | trạng thể chất nào của Người được bảo hiểm đã có trước ngày
-- src:2091 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm có hiệu lực, mà có biểu hiện dấu hiệu hoặc
-- src:2092 | triệu chứng mà Người được bảo hiểm đã nhận biết được hoặc theo
-- src:2093 | lẽ thường phải nhận biết được.
DECLARE `The history of a condition` HAS
    `existed before the effective date of the Policy`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `presented signs or symptoms the Insured Person was aware of`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `presented signs or symptoms the Insured Person should reasonably have been aware of` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:911 | “Hospital” means a place which is licensed, registered or
-- src:912 | authorized under the relevant laws and regulations of the country
-- src:913 | in which it is situated as a medical or surgical hospital and whose
-- src:914 | main functions are not those of a spa, a hydro clinic, a place for
-- src:915 | persons with mental or nervous disorders, a clinic or facility
-- src:916 | for nursing, rest or convalescence, a home for the aged or a
-- src:917 | place for alcoholics or drug addicts. It must be under the constant
-- src:920 | supervision of a resident Physician.
-- src:2029 | “Bệnh viện” là nơi được cấp giấy phép, có đăng ký hoặc được cho
-- src:2030 | phép hoạt động theo các luật và các quy định có liên quan của nước
-- src:2031 | mà nó tọa lạc với vai trò là một bệnh viện y tế hoặc phẫu thuật
-- src:2032 | và các chức năng chính của nó không phải là các chức năng của
-- src:2033 | một spa, phòng khám chữa bệnh bằng nước, nơi dành cho những
-- src:2034 | người bị các rối loạn thần kinh hoặc tâm thần, phòng khám hoặc
-- src:2035 | cơ sở điều dưỡng, nghỉ ngơi hay an dưỡng, nhà dưỡng lão hoặc
-- src:2036 | nơi cai nghiện rượu hoặc ma túy. Bệnh viện phải được đặt dưới sự
-- src:2037 | giám sát thường xuyên của một Bác sĩ nội trú.
DECLARE `A medical facility` HAS
    `licensed, registered or authorized under local law as a medical or surgical hospital` IS A BOOLEAN
    `main functions are those of a spa, hydro clinic, mental-health place, nursing, rest or convalescence facility, home for the aged, or place for alcoholics or drug addicts` IS A BOOLEAN
    `under the constant supervision of a resident Physician`              IS A BOOLEAN

-- How a person stands to the Insured Person. The English and the Vietnamese definitions of
-- Immediate Family Members differ on adoptive parents (NOTES.md §4, VN-F6), so an adoptive
-- parent is its own member.
-- src:924 | “Immediate Family Members” means an Insured Person’s legal
-- src:925 | spouse, children (natural or adopted), siblings, siblings-in- law,
-- src:926 | parents, parents in law, grandparents, grandchildren, legal
-- src:927 | guardian, stepparents or stepchildren.
-- src:2041 | “Người thân gia đình trực hệ” là vợ/chồng hợp pháp của Người
-- src:2042 | được bảo hiểm, các con (con ruột hoặc con nuôi), anh chị em ruột,
-- src:2043 | anh chị em dâu rể, cha mẹ ruột, cha mẹ vợ/chồng, ông bà nội ngoại,
-- src:2049 | cháu nội ngoại, người giám hộ hợp pháp, cha mẹ kế hay con riêng
-- src:2050 | của vợ/chồng.
DECLARE `Family relation` IS ONE OF
    `legal spouse`
    `natural child`
    `adopted child`
    `sibling`
    `sibling-in-law`
    `natural parent`
    `adoptive parent`
    `parent-in-law`
    `grandparent`
    `grandchild`
    `legal guardian`
    `stepparent`
    `stepchild`
    `no family relation the definition names`

-- src:881 | “Close Business Partner” means a business associate that has a
-- src:882 | share in the Insured Person’s business.
-- src:2001 | “Cộng sự làm ăn thân thiết” là người cùng cộng tác kinh doanh có
-- src:2002 | phần hùn trong công việc kinh doanh của Người được bảo hiểm.
DECLARE `A person related to the Insured Person` HAS
    `relation`                                                IS A `Family relation`
    `a business associate with a share in the Insured Person's business` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a travel companion also insured under the same Policy`   IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:967 | “Public Conveyance” means all public common carrier such
-- src:968 | as multi-engined aircrafts, buses, trains, ships, hovercrafts, ferries,
-- src:969 | and taxis that are licensed to carry fare-paying passengers and
-- src:970 | coach being arranged by travel agency and is not a contractor or
-- src:972 | private carrier.
-- src:2094 | “Phương tiện vận chuyển công cộng” là tất cả các phương tiện
-- src:2095 | vận chuyển công cộng thông thường như máy bay đa động cơ, xe
-- src:2096 | buýt, xe lửa, tàu thủy, tàu chạy bằng đệm không khí, phà và taxi
-- src:2097 | được cấp giấy phép chở khách có bán vé và xe buýt đường dài do
-- src:2098 | đại lý du lịch thu xếp và không phải là phương tiện vận chuyển của
-- src:2099 | nhà thầu hoặc của tư nhân.
DECLARE `Kind of conveyance` IS ONE OF
    `a multi-engined aircraft`
    `a bus`
    `a train`
    `a ship`
    `a hovercraft`
    `a ferry`
    `a taxi`
    `a coach arranged by a travel agency`
    `another conveyance`

DECLARE `A conveyance` HAS
    `kind`                                                     IS A `Kind of conveyance`
    `a public common carrier`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `licensed to carry fare-paying passengers`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `a contractor or private carrier`                          IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Nouns for the insuring sections`

§§ `Section 1A — Medical Expenses`

-- src:263 | a. Hospitalization, surgery, ambulance and paramedic
-- src:1362 | a. Viện phí, phí phẫu thuật, các dịch vụ xe cấp cứu và nhân
DECLARE `Kind of medical expense` IS ONE OF
    `hospitalization`
    `surgery`
    `ambulance and paramedic services`
    `diagnostic tests`
    `consultation by registered doctors`
    `medicines prescribed`
    `hospital room and board, charged on a per diem basis`
    `all charges for a day in hospital, inclusive of room and board and professional services`
    `special or private nursing`
    `physiotherapy, chiropractic or acupuncture`
    `cosmetic surgery`
    `eyeglasses or hearing aids, or prescriptions for them`
    `birth control by surgical, mechanical or chemical methods, or infertility treatment`
    `a routine physical examination or health check-up`
    `an expense section 1A.1(a) does not name`

DECLARE `A medical expense` HAS
    `kind`                                                 IS A `Kind of medical expense`
    `amount`                                               IS A NUMBER
    `date incurred`                                        IS A DATE
    `incurred outside the Country of Origin`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `a detailed breakdown of charges provided`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `supported by original receipts and medical reports with full diagnosis by a Physician` IS A BOOLEAN
    `normal, customary and reasonable`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `normal and customary charge for the same in the country where incurred` IS A NUMBER
    `normal and customary charge for the same in the country where paid`     IS A NUMBER
    `on the recommendation of a Physician`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `payable by any other insurance, or a third party may be liable for it` IS A BOOLEAN
    `incidental to the treatment or diagnosis of a covered Disability` IS A BOOLEAN
    `necessitated to correct a condition resulting solely from an external accidental Injury during the Period of Insurance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `arising immediately following discharge from hospital after return to the Country of Origin` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `The Disability` HAS
    `facts`                                                   IS A `The facts of an Illness or Injury`
    `history`                                                 IS A `The history of a condition`
    `contracted or sustained outside the Country of Origin`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `date contracted or sustained`                            IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `a psychiatric, psychological, mental or nervous disorder, or insanity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `related to pregnancy`                                    IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A Medical Expenses claim` HAS
    `the Disability`                                          IS A `The Disability`
    `expenses`                                                IS A LIST OF `A medical expense`
    `the Insured Person is unable to return to the Country of Origin, or to the final destination` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 1B — Emergency Assistance`

-- What the caller to the assistance company must identify (section 1B, preamble).
-- src:325 | The party making such contact will be required to identify the
-- src:326 | Insured Person’s name, Insurance Certificate Number or Policy
-- src:1421 | Người liên hệ với Công ty trợ giúp phải khai rõ tên Người được
-- src:1422 | bảo hiểm, số Giấy chứng nhận bảo hiểm hoặc số Hợp đồng bảo
DECLARE `A call to the assistance company` HAS
    `identifies the Insured Person's name`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `identifies the Insurance Certificate or Policy Number`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `identifies the Member Number`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `identifies the nature of the problem, the location and a contact person` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `An Emergency Assistance claim` HAS
    `the Disability`                                          IS A `The Disability`
    `findings`                                                IS A `A Physician's findings`
    `requires immediate treatment`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `adequate medical facilities available in the immediate vicinity` IS A BOOLEAN
    `prior approval taken from the Company`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `arranged and coordinated by the Company's designated assistance company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `cost of the emergency evacuation`                        IS A NUMBER
    `repatriation medically necessary`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the original ticket is valid for the purpose`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the unused portion of the ticket surrendered to the Company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `repatriation decided jointly by the attending physician and the Company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `cost of the repatriation`                                IS A NUMBER
    `hospital bills expected to amount to`                    IS A NUMBER

-- A stay in hospital, for the Hospital Cash Allowance and the Family Member Visit.
-- src:364 | a. Such hospitalization shall be in excess of 24 hours in
-- src:365 | duration and that the medical or surgical condition
-- src:1456 | a. Người được bảo hiểm phải nằm viện trên 24 giờ và tình
DECLARE `A stay in hospital` HAS
    `hours as an inpatient`                                   IS A NUMBER
    `calendar days on which the Insured Person was an inpatient` IS A NUMBER
    `the cause is acute`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `documentation produced showing the date, time, duration and place, with a copy of the medical report` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the documentation is satisfactory to the Company`        IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `Kind of travel cost` IS ONE OF
    `economy class travel`
    `travel in a class above economy`
    `accommodation`

DECLARE `A travel or accommodation cost` HAS
    `kind`                                                    IS A `Kind of travel cost`
    `amount`                                                  IS A NUMBER
    `reasonable`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `additional`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `incurred by`                                             IS A MAYBE `A person related to the Insured Person`
-- `incurred by` is NOTHING for a cost the Insured Person incurred.

-- Who the Return of Children benefit turns on.
-- src:396 | are left unattended overseas as a result of Serious Injury,
-- src:397 | Illness, or hospitalization, or death of the Insured Person, the
-- src:1494 | có người chăm sóc ở nước ngoài do Người được bảo hiểm bị
-- src:1495 | Thương tích nghiêm trọng hoặc Ốm đau nặng, nằm viện hay
DECLARE `What befell the Insured Person` IS ONE OF
    `Serious Injury`
    `a Serious Illness`
    `an Illness that is not serious`
    `hospitalization`
    `death`
    `nothing the wording names`

§§ `Section 2 — Personal Accident`

-- The six rows of the table in section 2.3, in the order printed, and the residual.
-- src:442 | Accidental Death 100%
-- src:443 | Total and irrecoverable loss of sight in one or both
-- src:444 | 100%
-- src:445 | eyes
-- src:446 | Total loss of one or more limbs 100%
-- src:447 | Total and irremediable loss of use of two or more
-- src:448 | 100%
-- src:449 | limbs
-- src:450 | Permanent Total Disablement 100%
-- src:452 | Total and irremediable loss of use of one limb 50%
-- src:1537 | Tử vong do tai nạn 100%
-- src:1538 | Mất hoàn toàn thị lực và không thể phục hồi được
-- src:1539 | 100%
-- src:1540 | của một hoặc cả hai mắt
-- src:1541 | Mất hoàn toàn một hoặc hơn một chi 100%
-- src:1542 | Mất hoàn toàn khả năng sử dụng và không thể chữa
-- src:1543 | 100%
-- src:1544 | được của hai hoặc hơn hai chi
-- src:1545 | Thương tật toàn bộ vĩnh viễn 100%
-- src:1546 | Mất hoàn toàn khả năng sử dụng và không thể chữa
-- src:1547 | 50%
-- src:1548 | được của một chi
DECLARE `A loss in the Personal Accident table` IS ONE OF
    `Accidental Death`
    `Total and irrecoverable loss of sight in one or both eyes`
    `Total loss of one or more limbs`
    `Total and irremediable loss of use of two or more limbs`
    `Permanent Total Disablement`
    `Total and irremediable loss of use of one limb`
    `a loss the table does not name`

-- src:935 | “Loss of Limb” means loss by physical severance of a hand at or
-- src:936 | above the wrist or of a foot at or above the ankle.
-- src:937 | “Loss of sight” means the entire and irrecoverable loss of sight.
-- src:2060 | “Mất chi” là sự mất do bị cắt rời một bàn tay tại hoặc trên cổ tay
-- src:2061 | hay một bàn chân tại hoặc trên mắt cá chân.
-- src:2062 | “Mất thị lực” là mất hoàn toàn thị lực và không thể phục hồi được.
-- src:947 | “Permanent Total Disablement” means disablement which
-- src:948 | entirely prevents an Insured Person from attending to his
-- src:949 | occupation or employment of any and every kind and which
-- src:950 | disablement lasts 52 consecutive weeks and at the expiry of that
-- src:951 | period is beyond hope of any improvement.
-- src:2074 | “Thương tật toàn bộ vĩnh viễn” là thương tật làm cho Người
-- src:2075 | được bảo hiểm hoàn toàn không thể làm công việc nghề nghiệp
-- src:2076 | của mình hoặc bất kỳ công việc nào khác trong 52 tuần liên tục và
-- src:2077 | vào lúc kết thúc thời gian đó thì cũng không có hy vọng cải thiện.
DECLARE `The facts of a disablement` HAS
    `physical severance of a hand at or above the wrist, or of a foot at or above the ankle` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the loss of sight is entire and irrecoverable`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `entirely prevents attending to an occupation or employment of any and every kind` IS A BOOLEAN
    `consecutive weeks the disablement has lasted`            IS A NUMBER
    `beyond hope of any improvement at the expiry of that period` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A Personal Accident claim` HAS
    `the loss claimed`                                        IS A `A loss in the Personal Accident table`
    `the Injury`                                              IS A `The facts of an Illness or Injury`
    `disablement`                                             IS A `The facts of a disablement`
    `date of the Accident`                                    IS A DATE
    `date of the death or disablement`                        IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `travelling as a fare-paying passenger on board`          IS A MAYBE `A conveyance`
    `a Personal Accident benefit has already become payable for this Insured Person` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 3 — Baggage and Personal Effects`

-- src:482 | This section of the Policy provides indemnity for loss, physical
-- src:483 | breakage or damage directly resulting from theft, robbery,
-- src:484 | burglary, Accident or mishandling by carriers occurring during
-- src:485 | the Period of Insurance to an Insured Person’s baggage or personal
-- src:486 | property carried on the journey.
-- src:1577 | Mục này cung cấp sự bồi thường cho hành lý hoặc đồ dùng cá
-- src:1578 | nhân của Người được bảo hiểm mang theo trong chuyến đi bị mất,
-- src:1579 | vỡ hoặc bị hư hại trong Thời gian bảo hiểm mà nguyên nhân trực
-- src:1580 | tiếp là do bị trộm cắp, cướp, tai nạn hoặc do việc xử lý sai của nhà
-- src:1581 | vận chuyển.
DECLARE `Cause of a loss of property` IS ONE OF
    `theft`
    `robbery`
    `burglary`
    `an Accident`
    `mishandling by carriers`
    `accidental loss without an Accident`
    `another cause`

DECLARE `Loss or damage` IS ONE OF
    `loss`
    `physical breakage or damage`

-- The kinds of article section 3 treats differently: the limits in 3.3 and the classes the
-- exclusions in 3.6 name.
-- src:506 | 3. The limit of the Company’s liability is VND 5,000,000 for each
-- src:507 | item and VND 10,000,000 for each pair or set. Loss of laptop
-- src:508 | computer is limited to VND 20,000,000 for Premier Plan, and
-- src:509 | VND 10,000,000 for other plans. Camera body, lenses and
-- src:510 | accessories will be treated as a set;
-- src:1605 | 3. Mức bồi thường tối đa là 5.000.000 VND cho mỗi vật dụng và
-- src:1606 | 10.000.000 VND cho mỗi đôi hoặc bộ. Mức bồi thường tối đa
-- src:1607 | cho máy tính xách tay bị mất là 20.000.000 VND cho Hạng cao
-- src:1608 | cấp, và 10.000.000 VND cho các hạng khác. Thân máy ảnh/máy
-- src:1609 | quay phim, các ống kính và các phụ kiện được xem là 1 bộ;
DECLARE `Kind of article` IS ONE OF
    `an article section 3 does not single out`
    `a laptop computer`
    `a camera body, lens or accessory`
    `cash, bank notes, negotiable instruments, bonds, securities, credit cards, other instruments of payment, or documents`
    `a passport, visa, air ticket, or a transportation, accommodation or other travel voucher or coupon`
    `a pager, mobile phone or its accessories, portable electronic device, computer equipment, software or related accessories`
    `a fragile or brittle article, china, glassware, porcelain, objet d'art, gemstone, eyeglasses, contact lenses or foodstuff`
    `business merchandise or samples`
    `jewelry`
    `a suitcase, bag or other luggage container`

DECLARE `An article` HAS
    `kind`                                                    IS A `Kind of article`
    `loss or damage`                                          IS A `Loss or damage`
    `amount of the loss`                                      IS A NUMBER
    `the pair or set it belongs to`                           IS A MAYBE STRING
    `carried on the journey as baggage`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `in consequence of delay, confiscation, detention or examination by customs or other officials` IS A BOOLEAN
    `wear and tear, moth, vermin, inherent vice, derangement, cleaning or restoring, atmospheric change, or depreciation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `left behind or unattended in a Public Conveyance or a Public Place` IS A BOOLEAN
    `mailed or shipped separately`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `specifically insured elsewhere, or recovered or repaired by a third party` IS A BOOLEAN
    `lost by armed robbery, or by burglary from a hotel safety deposit box` IS A BOOLEAN
    `produced for the Company's inspection`                   IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:488 | 1. The loss must be reported to the local police where the loss
-- src:489 | occurs, the carriers or any third parties liable within 24 hours
-- src:490 | of the occurrence;
-- src:1584 | 1. Tổn thất phải được thông báo cho cảnh sát địa phương nơi
-- src:1585 | xảy ra sự cố, các nhà vận chuyển hoặc các bên thứ ba có trách
-- src:1586 | nhiệm trong vòng 24 giờ kể từ khi xảy ra sự cố;
DECLARE `A Baggage and Personal Effects claim` HAS
    `cause`                                                   IS A `Cause of a loss of property`
    `date of the occurrence`                                  IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `hours from the occurrence to the report to the local police, the carriers or a liable third party` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `ordinary and proper care observed`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `in transit when lost or damaged`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `immediate notice given to the police, with written documentation from the local police` IS A BOOLEAN
    `immediate notice given to the carriers, with a copy of the Baggage Irregularity Report` IS A BOOLEAN
    `articles`                                                IS A LIST OF `An article`

§§ `Section 4 — Baggage Delay`

DECLARE `Cause of a baggage delay` IS ONE OF
    `delay`
    `misdirection`
    `non-delivery`
    `detention or confiscation by customs or other government officials`

DECLARE `An emergency purchase` HAS
    `amount`                                                  IS A NUMBER
    `essential toiletries or clothing`                        IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:562 | of essential items of toiletries and clothing consequent upon
-- src:563 | temporary deprivation of baggage for at least 6 hours from the
-- src:564 | time of arrival at destination abroad due to delay, misdirection,
-- src:565 | or non-delivery.
-- src:1667 | khẩn cấp những vật dụng vệ sinh và áo quần cần thiết do hành lý
-- src:1668 | bị thất lạc ít nhất 6 tiếng kể từ khi đến nơi đến nước ngoài do hành
-- src:1669 | lý bị chậm trễ, giao nhầm hoặc không giao.
DECLARE `A Baggage Delay claim` HAS
    `cause`                                                   IS A `Cause of a baggage delay`
    `date of arrival at the destination abroad`               IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `hours of deprivation from arrival at the destination abroad` IS A NUMBER
    `the destination abroad is the final destination of the journey` IS A BOOLEAN
    `certified by a Baggage Irregularity Report or a tour operator's letter` IS A BOOLEAN
    `documentation including original purchase bills produced` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the same loss is claimed under section 3`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `purchases`                                               IS A LIST OF `An emergency purchase`

§§ `Section 5 — Loss of Travel Document`

-- src:588 | If an Insured Person loses his passport, air tickets and travel
-- src:589 | documents arising from theft, robbery, burglary and accidental
-- src:590 | loss during a trip covered by this Policy, the Company will
-- src:1689 | Nếu Người được bảo hiểm bị mất hộ chiếu, vé máy bay và các giấy
-- src:1690 | tờ du lịch do bị trộm cắp, cướp hoặc tai nạn trong chuyến đi được
-- src:1691 | bảo hiểm bởi Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này thì Công ty sẽ bồi thường
DECLARE `A Loss of Travel Document claim` HAS
    `cause`                                                   IS A `Cause of a loss of property`
    `date of the loss`                                        IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `during a trip covered by this Policy`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `hours from awareness of the loss to the police report`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `reported as soon as practicable`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `a copy of the police report obtained`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the documents were left unattended in a public place`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `cost of obtaining replacement passports, air tickets and travel documents` IS A NUMBER
    `additional hotel accommodation and travel expenses, day by day` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    `cost of returning to the Country of Origin`              IS A NUMBER
    `economy class fare for that return`                      IS A NUMBER

§§ `Section 6 — Personal Money`

-- src:618 | The Company will indemnify the Insured Person against loss of
-- src:619 | personal money in the form of bank notes, cash or travelers checks
-- src:620 | directly arising only from theft, robbery or burglary up to the limit
-- src:621 | set out in the Insurance Certificate.
-- src:1719 | Công ty sẽ bồi thường cho Người được bảo hiểm về những mất
-- src:1720 | mát tiền cá nhân dưới hình thức ngân phiếu, tiền mặt hoặc séc
-- src:1721 | du lịch chỉ do bị trộm cắp, cướp. Mức bồi thường tối đa được ghi
DECLARE `A Personal Money claim` HAS
    `cause`                                                   IS A `Cause of a loss of property`
    `date of the loss`                                        IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `amount lost in bank notes, cash or travelers checks`     IS A NUMBER
    `travelers checks among the money lost`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `hours from the loss to the report to the local police`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `hours from the loss to the report to the travelers checks issuer` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
    `due to error, omission, exchange-rate fluctuation, confiscation or devaluation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `carried on the person and not left without personal immediate attendance` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 7 — Travel Delay`

DECLARE `Cause of a travel delay` IS ONE OF
    `serious weather conditions`
    `industrial action`
    `hijack`
    `technical or other mechanical failure of the aircraft or conveyance`
    `another cause`

DECLARE `Paragraph claimed under section 7` IS ONE OF
    `7(a), the allowance for each 6 hours`
    `7(b), public transportation expenses on re-routing`

-- src:637 | In the event the Insured Person’s flight or other scheduled mode of
-- src:638 | transportation is delayed outside the Insured’s Country of Origin
-- src:639 | during the Period of Insurance due to serious weather conditions,
-- src:640 | industrial action, hijack, technical or other mechanical failure of
-- src:641 | aircraft or conveyances and the cancellation or postponement
-- src:642 | thereof due to such fault is entirely beyond the control of the
-- src:643 | Insured Person:
-- src:1741 | Trong trường hợp chuyến bay hoặc phương tiện vận chuyển chạy
-- src:1742 | theo lịch khác của Người được bảo hiểm bị chậm trễ ở ngoài Nước
-- src:1743 | xuất phát trong Thời gian bảo hiểm do điều kiện thời tiết xấu, bãi
-- src:1744 | công, không tặc, trục trặc máy móc hoặc kỹ thuật của máy bay
-- src:1745 | hay các phương tiện vận chuyển và sự hủy bỏ hoặc trì hoãn do
-- src:1746 | những sự cố đó hoàn toàn ngoài tầm kiểm soát của Người được
-- src:1747 | bảo hiểm thì:
DECLARE `A Travel Delay claim` HAS
    `cause`                                                   IS A `Cause of a travel delay`
    `date of the delay`                                       IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `delayed outside the Country of Origin during the Period of Insurance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `entirely beyond the control of the Insured Person`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `hours of delay`                                          IS A NUMBER
    `the Insured Person failed to reconfirm the booking or to check in on time` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the booking was confirmed before the industrial action commenced` IS A BOOLEAN
    `official documentation from the carrier stating the cause, date, time and duration` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the strike or industrial action existed at the effective date of the Policy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the strike or industrial action existed on the scheduled commencement date of travel` IS A BOOLEAN
    `arises from confiscation or detention by government authorities` IS A BOOLEAN
    `paragraph claimed`                                       IS A `Paragraph claimed under section 7`
    `public transportation expenses necessarily incurred`     IS A NUMBER
    `re-routed because a prior confirmed booking was cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 8 — Curtailment of Trip or Cancellation Charges`

-- src:690 | 1. Death, Serious Injury or Illness, befalling the Insured Person;
-- src:691 | 2. Death, Serious Injury or Illness, afflicting an Insured Person’s
-- src:692 | Immediate Family Members, Close Business Partner, or a
-- src:693 | travel companion who is also insured under the same policy
-- src:694 | of the Insured Person;
-- src:695 | 3. Witness summons, jury service or compulsory quarantine of
-- src:696 | the Insured Person;
-- src:697 | 4. Natural disasters (earthquake, flood, hurricane, tornado,
-- src:698 | tsunami, etc.) at the planned destination;
-- src:699 | 5. Complete destruction of an Insured Person’s principal
-- src:700 | residence in the Country of Origin.
-- src:1796 | 1. Người được bảo hiểm bị tử vong, bị Thương tích nghiêm trọng
-- src:1797 | hoặc Ốm đau nặng;
-- src:1798 | 2. Người thân gia đình trực hệ, Cộng sự làm ăn thân thiết, hoặc
-- src:1799 | người bạn đồng hành của Người được bảo hiểm mà người này
-- src:1800 | cũng được bảo hiểm trong cùng hợp đồng bảo hiểm với Người
-- src:1801 | được bảo hiểm bị tử vong, bị Thương tích nghiêm trọng hoặc
-- src:1802 | Ốm đau nặng;
-- src:1803 | 3. Người được bảo hiểm được mời làm chứng, làm thành viên
-- src:1804 | trong bồi thẩm đoàn hoặc bị kiểm dịch bắt buộc;
-- src:1805 | 4. Thiên tai (động đất, lũ lụt, bão, lốc xoáy, sóng thần,…) tại nơi
-- src:1806 | đến đã định theo kế hoạch;
-- src:1807 | 5. Nơi cư trú chính ở Nước xuất phát của Người được bảo hiểm
-- src:1808 | bị phá hủy hoàn toàn.
DECLARE `A cause named in section 8` IS ONE OF
    `death, Serious Injury or Illness befalling the Insured Person`
    `death, Serious Injury or Illness afflicting` HAS `the person` IS A `A person related to the Insured Person`
    `witness summons, jury service or compulsory quarantine of the Insured Person`
    `a natural disaster at the planned destination`
    `complete destruction of the Insured Person's principal residence in the Country of Origin`
    `a cause section 8 does not name`

DECLARE `Cancellation or curtailment` IS ONE OF
    `cancellation of the planned trip`
    `curtailment of the trip`

-- src:683 | The Insured Person shall be indemnified against loss of all
-- src:684 | non-refundable prepaid travel arrangement deposits of every
-- src:685 | description, or any increased cost of travel in respect of the
-- src:686 | least expensive alternative mode of transport or reasonable
-- src:1788 | Người được bảo hiểm sẽ được bồi thường cho việc mất tất cả
-- src:1789 | những khoản đặt cọc cho việc sắp xếp chuyến đi đã trả trước
-- src:1790 | nhưng không được hoàn lại dưới mọi hình thức, hoặc cho những
-- src:1791 | chi phí tăng thêm cho việc đi lại bằng phương thức vận chuyển
-- src:1792 | thay thế có mức ít tốn kém nhất hoặc chỗ ở hợp lý. Mức bồi thường
DECLARE `A section 8 claim` HAS
    `kind`                                                    IS A `Cancellation or curtailment`
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `cause`                                                   IS A `A cause named in section 8`
    `the cause is a death`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `findings`                                                IS A `A Physician's findings`
    `date the cause arose`                                    IS A DATE
    `date of the cancellation or curtailment`                 IS A DATE
    `the cause arises from conditions or circumstances known to exist on the date of issue of the Policy` IS A BOOLEAN
    `arises from pregnancy, childbirth or gynecological disease or their sequelae` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Insured Person abandoned the planned trip, or cut it short by returning to the Country of Residence or Origin` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the natural disaster occurred suddenly after commencement of travel and prevents continuing the trip` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the destruction was by fire, flood, earthquake or similar disaster after commencement of travel and requires the Insured Person's presence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `non-refundable prepaid travel and accommodation charges`  IS A NUMBER
    `unused portion of those charges, as a fraction`          IS A NUMBER
    `increased cost of travel by the least expensive alternative, or of reasonable accommodation` IS A NUMBER

§§ `Section 9 — Personal Liability`

DECLARE `Kind of harm to a third party` IS ONE OF
    `accidental bodily injury to a third party`
    `accidental loss of or damage to a third party's property`
    `another kind of harm`

-- The list is quoted limb by limb in pc-travel-part3-trip-liability.l4.
-- src:745 | ii. arising directly or indirectly from:
-- src:1863 | (ii) phát sinh trực tiếp hoặc gián tiếp từ:
DECLARE `A circumstance named in section 9(ii)` IS ONE OF
    `employer's liability`                                                    -- (a)
    `contractual liability`                                                   -- (a)
    `liability to an Immediate Family Member` HAS `the person` IS A `A person related to the Insured Person` -- (a)
    `property or animals belonging to, held in trust by, or in the care, custody or control of the Insured Person` -- (b)
    `a willful, malicious, unlawful or deliberate act`                        -- (c)
    `the pursuit of a trade, business or profession`                          -- (d)
    `ownership or occupation of land or buildings` HAS `occupation only of a temporary residence` IS A BOOLEAN -- (e)
    `ownership, possession, hire, use or operation of a motorized vehicle, aircraft or watercraft` -- (f)
    `legal costs resulting from criminal proceedings`                         -- (g)
    `insanity`                                                                -- (h)
    `the use of a drug` HAS
        `medically prescribed` IS A BOOLEAN
        `drug addiction`       IS A BOOLEAN                                   -- (h)
    `intoxicating liquor`                                                     -- (h)
    `the use of a weapon` HAS `a firearm` IS A BOOLEAN                         -- (h)
    `bailments, contractual licenses, or conveyances of real estate or personal property` -- (i)

DECLARE `Judgement on the liability` IS ONE OF
    `no judgement`
    `a judgement in the first instance of a court of competent jurisdiction within the Country of Origin`
    `a judgement in the first instance of another court`

-- src:738 | Provided that it is a result of:
-- src:739 | 1. Accidental bodily injury to third party;
-- src:740 | 2. Accidental loss or damage to third party’s property.
-- src:1855 | Với điều kiện trách nhiệm đó là do:
-- src:1856 | 1. Bên thứ ba bị Thương tích thân thể do tai nạn;
-- src:1857 | 2. Tài sản của bên thứ ba bị mất mát hoặc hư hại do tai nạn.
DECLARE `A Personal Liability claim` HAS
    `date of the event`                                       IS A DATE
    `harm`                                                    IS A `Kind of harm to a third party`
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `arose from, under section 9(ii)`                         IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in section 9(ii)`
    `payable by any other insurance company or third party`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `judgement`                                               IS A `Judgement on the liability`
    `damages for the legal liability`                         IS A NUMBER
    `the third party's reasonable costs and expenses`         IS A NUMBER
    `legal costs and expenses`                                IS A NUMBER

§§ `Section 10 — Incidental Home Country`

-- src:775 | During the Period of Insurance, an Insured Person may return
-- src:776 | to the Country of Origin for incidental visits up to a consecutive
-- src:777 | period of 14 days.
-- src:1891 | Trong suốt Thời gian bảo hiểm, Người được bảo hiểm có thể trở về
-- src:1892 | Nước xuất phát vì lý do đột xuất trong thời gian tối đa là 14 ngày
-- src:1894 | liên tục cho mỗi lần.
DECLARE `A return to the Country of Origin` HAS
    `the Insured Person had departed from the Country of Origin` IS A BOOLEAN
    `consecutive days in the Country of Origin`               IS A NUMBER
    `the cause arises from circumstances known to the Insured Person before or on the effective date` IS A BOOLEAN
    `for the purpose of seeking medical treatment`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `for an unexpected reason`                                IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 11 — Rental Car Excess Cover`

-- src:805 | 1. The car is rented from a recognized licensed car rental company;
-- src:1920 | 1. Chiếc xe ô tô phải được thuê từ một công ty cho thuê xe ô tô
-- src:1921 | có giấy phép;
DECLARE `A car rental company` HAS
    `licensed`                                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `recognized`                                              IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `A Rental Car Excess claim` HAS
    `date of the loss or damage`                              IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `excess under a valid Car Insurance Policy the Insured Person is liable to pay` IS A NUMBER
    `for accidental loss of or damage to a car rented by the Insured Person` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Insured Person was the driver and is specified in the car rental contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `rental company`                                          IS A `A car rental company`
    `comprehensive car insurance bought as part of the rental contract` IS A BOOLEAN
    `complied with the rental contract, the car insurance policy and local law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `due to a breach of the rental contract or car insurance policy, or a violation of local law` IS A BOOLEAN
    `occurred outside a public road`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `due to wear and tear, insect or rodent, depreciation, inherent vice, or implicit damage` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Section 12 — Optional Rental Car Protection`

DECLARE `Cause of damage to a rental car` IS ONE OF
    `fire`
    `theft`
    `collision`
    `vandalism`
    `an Accident other than those`
    `another cause`

DECLARE `Kind of rented vehicle` IS ONE OF
    `a car`
    `a truck with a manufacturer's rated load capacity over 2,000 pounds`
    `a truck with a manufacturer's rated load capacity of 2,000 pounds or less`
    `a camper`
    `a trailer`
    `an off road vehicle`
    `a motorbike`
    `a sports utility vehicle`
    `a recreational vehicle`

-- src:845 | This optional “Rental Car Protection” benefit does not cover:
-- src:1970 | Quyền lợi lựa chọn “Bảo hiểm xe ô tô thuê” này không bảo hiểm cho:
DECLARE `A Rental Car Protection claim` HAS
    `cause`                                                   IS A `Cause of damage to a rental car`
    `date of the loss or damage`                              IS A DATE
    `arose from`                                              IS A LIST OF `A circumstance named in clause 5`
    `vehicle`                                                 IS A `Kind of rented vehicle`
    `rental company`                                          IS A `A car rental company`
    `damage for which the Insured Person is responsible under the rental agreement` IS A NUMBER
    `police report, itemized statement of repairs and other evidence submitted` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Insured Person cooperated with the Company`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `driving whilst intoxicated or under the influence of drugs or narcotics` IS A BOOLEAN
    `intentional loss or damage`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `an obligation the Insured Person assumed under an agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `use of the car in violation of the rental agreement`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `a liability, personal Injury or property damage`         IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Other insurance`

-- src:868 | The maximum liability of the Company in respect of all claims
-- src:869 | shall not exceed its ratable proportion of such claim which but
-- src:870 | for the existence of this Policy would be covered under any other
-- src:871 | insurance policies or cover notes. (This does not apply to the
-- src:872 | “Personal Accident” section of this Policy.)
