DECLARE `Other insurance` HAS
    `limit under the other insurance policies or cover notes` IS A NUMBER

§ `Nouns for the conditions and the Claims Procedure`

§§ `Extension, Travel Flex and Annual Travel`

-- src:115 | 8. Extension of cover beyond the expiration date will be granted
-- src:116 | prior to the expiry of the policy provided the Insured Person
-- src:117 | is not actively being treated or under the supervision of a
-- src:118 | Physician or Surgeon at the time of asking for extension, and
-- src:119 | the total length of the trip does not exceed 180 days.
-- src:1208 | 8. Việc gia hạn bảo hiểm khi hết thời gian bảo hiểm sẽ được thực
-- src:1209 | hiện trước khi Hợp đồng bảo hiểm hết hiệu lực với điều kiện
-- src:1210 | là Người được bảo hiểm hiện không đang được điều trị hay
-- src:1211 | dưới sự theo dõi của Bác sĩ hay Bác sĩ phẫu thuật tại thời điểm
-- src:1212 | xin gia hạn bảo hiểm, và tổng thời gian được bảo hiểm không
-- src:1213 | vượt quá 180 ngày.
DECLARE `A request to extend the cover` HAS
    `date of asking`                                          IS A DATE
    `actively being treated or under the supervision of a Physician or Surgeon at the time of asking` IS A BOOLEAN
    `total length of the trip in days`                        IS A NUMBER
    `total days insured, the extension included`              IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `Cause of a Travel Flex delay` IS ONE OF
    `the Insured Person required to suspend the trip on the advice of a registered medical practitioner`
    `a delay to a vehicle, vessel or aircraft carrying the Insured Person as a ticket holding passenger, so the homeward journey is not completed during the Period of Insurance`
    `another cause`

-- src:192 | Free extension of the period of cover, maximum of 5 days. If there
-- src:193 | is a delay outside of the control of the Insured Person:
-- src:1288 | Gia hạn Thời gian bảo hiểm thêm tối đa 5 ngày miễn phí nếu có sự
-- src:1289 | chậm trễ ngoài tầm kiểm soát của Người được bảo hiểm:
DECLARE `A Travel Flex delay` HAS
    `cause`                                                   IS A `Cause of a Travel Flex delay`
    `outside the control of the Insured Person`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `days to complete the journey by the next available and convenient transportation` IS A NUMBER

DECLARE `Party to the Policy` IS ONE OF
    `the Company`
    `the Policyholder`
    `the Insured Person`

-- The acts the regulative rules name (AT 1, AT 4, section 1B.9, the Claims Procedure).
DECLARE `An act under the Policy` IS ONE OF
    `give written notice of the alteration to the Company`
    `renew the Policy`
    `provide referral services`
    `give notice of the claim`
    `give written notice of a possible Personal Liability claim`
    `provide the further information requested`

-- src:211 | 3. The Company may cancel this Policy by giving 7 days’ notice by
-- src:1310 | 3. Công ty có thể hủy Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này bằng cách gởi
DECLARE `A cancellation of an Annual Travel Policy` HAS
    `cancelled by`                                            IS A `Party to the Policy`
    `date of the notice`                                      IS A DATE
    `notice by registered letter`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of cancellation`                                    IS A DATE
    `a claim has arisen during the current Period of Insurance` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the current Policy and coverage card returned on or before the date of cancellation` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Disputes and claims`

-- src:173 | 17. Any difference arising between any Insured Person and the
-- src:1271 | 17. Bất cứ bất đồng nào phát sinh giữa Người được bảo hiểm và
DECLARE `A difference with the Company` HAS
    `requires medical knowledge`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the parties agreed on a single arbitrator`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `an award has been determined`                            IS A BOOLEAN

-- The sorts of document the Claims Procedure lists in 2(a)-(g).
-- Quoted letter by letter in pc-travel-claims.l4.
-- src:1018 | 2. All claims must be submitted with a completed Travel
-- src:1019 | Insurance Claims Form along with comprehensive supporting
-- src:1020 | information including:
-- src:2144 | 2. Tất cả mọi yêu cầu bồi thường phải được nộp cùng đơn Thông
-- src:2145 | báo tổn thất với các thông tin liên quan đầy đủ bao gồm:
DECLARE `A claim document` IS ONE OF
    `a completed Travel Insurance Claims Form`
    `hospital and physician's reports on the nature of the Injury and the extent and period of disability`
    `police reports where relevant`
    `a copy of the death certificate and the relevant coroner's report`
    `all bills, receipts, tickets, coupons, contracts, agreements and other supporting documents`
    `a full Physician's report with the diagnosis, the date the Disability commenced and a summary of the treatment`
    `receipts showing date of purchase, price, model and type of the items`
    `a copy of the IMMEDIATE notification to the airline or carrier and its written acknowledgement`
    `a certified written copy of IMMEDIATE police reports`
    `official documentation from the airline or carrier giving the cause, date, time and duration of the delay`
    `immediate written notification of the possible claim, confirming no admission or settlement`
    `copies of the summons, court documents and legal correspondence`
    `the car rental contract and the car insurance policy`
    `a certified written copy of the police report where the event occurred`
    `proof that the Car Insurance Company paid the claim`
    `an itemized statement of repairs and other documented evidence`

-- src:1003 | 1. Notice of any claim must be given to the Company within 30
-- src:1004 | days of the expiry of this Policy or the date of finishing the trip
-- src:1005 | covered by this Policy (applicable to Annual Travel), and in the
-- src:2128 | 1. Phải nộp thông báo yêu cầu bồi thường cho Công ty trong vòng
-- src:2129 | 30 ngày kể từ ngày kết thúc Hợp đồng bảo hiểm này hoặc kể
-- src:2130 | từ ngày kết thúc chuyến đi được bảo hiểm bởi Hợp đồng bảo
-- src:2131 | hiểm này (áp dụng đối với bảo hiểm du lịch Annual Travel),
DECLARE `The dates of a claim` HAS
    `date notice of the claim was given`                      IS A MAYBE DATE
    `notice given in writing`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of the incident`                                    IS A DATE
    `date the trip covered by this Policy finished`           IS A DATE
    `date of the Company's written request for further information` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the required information was received`              IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the Company disclaimed liability`                   IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the claim was referred to dispute resolution`       IS A MAYBE DATE
